<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Behold, You delight in truth</l><l>In the inward parts;</l><l>And in the hidden part</l><l>You would make known wisdom to me.</l><l>Purge my sin with hyssop, and I’ll be clean.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let me hear gladness and joy,</l><l>That the bones You’ve broken,</l><l>May exult, O God!</l><l>Do hide Your face from all my sins,</l><l>O God, blot out all my iniquities.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Create in me a clean heart,</l><l>And renew a steadfast</l><l>Spirit within me.</l><l>Do not cast me from Your presence,</l><l>And sustain me with a willing spirit.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
